<p>Call upon your deepest reserves of strength to win no matter the cost. </p><p>Immediately upon activation and every turn while this talent is active, your detrimental effects expire and your talents cool down as if an extra turn had passed. </p><p>This bonus cooldown occurs even if your talents would not normally cool down.</p><p>This talent deactivates automatically upon rest.</p><p>This strength comes at a cost: you lose <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 12%, 10%, 9%, 8%</acronym> of your maximum life every turn.  This can kill you.</p><p></p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">If you're lucky, this will take everything you've got.</span></span></p>